---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="首页">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-primary-light overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30">
      <svg
        class="w-full h-full"
        viewBox="0 0 100 100"
        preserveAspectRatio="none"
      >
        <defs>
          <pattern
            id="dots"
            x="0"
            y="0"
            width="20"
            height="20"
            patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
          >
            <circle cx="2" cy="2" r="1" fill="#2a7a6e" opacity="0.15"></circle>
          </pattern>
        </defs>
        <rect width="100" height="100" fill="url(#dots)"></rect>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-32">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/80 border border-primary/10 text-primary text-xs font-medium mb-6"
        >
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary animate-pulse"
          ></span>
          香港注册非牟利社会团体
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text leading-tight mb-6">
          香港儿童青年<br />心理健康协会
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-text-light leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-xl">
          连接学术与实践的心理专业平台，整合社会资源，全面促进儿童及青年的心理健康。
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a
            href="/services"
            class="px-6 py-3 bg-primary text-white rounded-xl font-medium text-sm hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-primary/20"
          >
            了解我们的服务
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
        <div>
          <span
            class="text-primary text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-3 block"
            >关于协会</span
          >
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text mb-6">协会简介</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-text-light leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              香港儿童青年心理健康协会为依法设立、非以牟利为目的之社会团体。协会致力整合社会各界资源，搭建一个连接学术研究与应用服务的心理专业平台，透过更系统、更可及的心理支持，全面促进儿童与青少年的心理健康，推动更幸福、友善与具支持力的社会环境。
            </p>
            <p>
              近年来，儿童青少年的精神心理困扰发生率持续上升，心理健康问题呈现「低龄化」趋势。孩子在学业压力、家庭与学校期望、社会环境快速变化，以及科技与信息爆炸等多重挑战之下，容易出现焦虑、情绪困扰、自我认同迷茫等问题。疫情后重新适应学习与社交节奏，也可能进一步加重压力与情绪负担。
            </p>
            <p>
              我们期望透过专业心理辅导、家庭与社区活动，协助儿童青少年建立健康的心理素质与更坚韧的应对能力。同时，我们也希望在社会各界共同努力与支持下，为儿童和青少年提供一个更安全、包容且充满机会的环境，帮助他们克服挑战、健康成长并充分发挥潜能。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <!-- Mission Card -->
          <div class="bg-secondary rounded-2xl p-8">
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-primary"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-text text-lg mb-3">宗旨</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-text-light text-sm">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 shrink-0"
                ></span>
                <span>整合社会各界资源，提供心理专业支持与服务</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 shrink-0"
                ></span>
                <span>建立连接学术与应用的专业平台，促进儿童及青年心理健康</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 shrink-0"
                ></span>
                <span>推动社会共同关注与支持，迈向幸福社会</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Values Card -->
          <div class="bg-primary-light rounded-2xl p-8">
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-primary"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-text text-lg mb-4">核心价值观</h3>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
                <div class="font-semibold text-primary text-sm mb-1">专业</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-text-muted">
                  以科学证据与专业伦理为基础
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
                <div class="font-semibold text-primary text-sm mb-1">仁爱</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-text-muted">
                  以关怀与同理支持每一位有需要的人
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
                <div class="font-semibold text-primary text-sm mb-1">尊重</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-text-muted">
                  尊重个体差异、成长节奏与家庭文化
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
                <div class="font-semibold text-primary text-sm mb-1">包容</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-text-muted">
                  营造安全、接纳与不评判的支持环境
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services Overview -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-secondary">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <span
          class="text-primary text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-3 block"
          >服务范畴</span
        >
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text">服务对象与范围</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
          <img
            src="https://placehold.co/400x220/e8f4f2/2a7a6e?text=心理健康服务"
            alt="心理健康服务"
            class="w-full h-36 object-cover rounded-xl mb-4"
          />
          <div
            class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">心理健康服务</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
          <img
            src="https://placehold.co/400x220/e8f4f2/2a7a6e?text=专业培训课程"
            alt="专业培训课程"
            class="w-full h-36 object-cover rounded-xl mb-4"
          />
          <div
            class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">专业培训课程</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
          <img
            src="https://placehold.co/400x220/e8f4f2/2a7a6e?text=讲座及工作坊"
            alt="讲座及工作坊"
            class="w-full h-36 object-cover rounded-xl mb-4"
          />

          <div
            class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">讲座及工作坊</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
          <img
            src="https://placehold.co/400x220/e8f4f2/2a7a6e?text=学术交流合作"
            alt="学术交流合作"
            class="w-full h-36 object-cover rounded-xl mb-4"
          />
          <div
            class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">学术交流合作</h3>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="/services"
          class="px-6 py-3 bg-primary text-white rounded-xl font-medium text-sm hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors"
        >
          了解辅导与治疗服务
        </a>
        <a
          href="/exam"
          class="px-6 py-3 bg-white text-text border border-gray-200 rounded-xl font-medium text-sm hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors"
        >
          查询培训课程
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Target Audience -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <span
        class="text-primary text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-3 block"
        >服务对象</span
      >
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text mb-8">我们服务的对象</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <div
          class="px-6 py-3 bg-primary-light rounded-full text-primary font-medium text-sm"
        >
          儿童
        </div>
        <div
          class="px-6 py-3 bg-primary-light rounded-full text-primary font-medium text-sm"
        >
          青少年
        </div>
        <div
          class="px-6 py-3 bg-primary-light rounded-full text-primary font-medium text-sm"
        >
          青年
        </div>
        <div
          class="px-6 py-3 bg-primary-light rounded-full text-primary font-medium text-sm"
        >
          家庭
        </div>
        <div
          class="px-6 py-3 bg-primary-light rounded-full text-primary font-medium text-sm"
        >
          教育工作者
        </div>
        <div
          class="px-6 py-3 bg-primary-light rounded-full text-primary font-medium text-sm"
        >
          专业人士
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
